            <th>Odoo Enterprise — Custom SaaS</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Pricing model</strong></td>
            <td>Per transaction volume (accounting entries/year) — users unlimited</td>
            <td>Per user / per month — all 50+ modules included</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Entry plan</strong></td>
            <td>~€25–29/mese (piano base, ~6,000 voci/anno)</td>
            <td>~€34–42/utente/mese (Custom plan, 1+ users)</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Typical TCA cost</strong><div class="aa-note">5 users, medium volume</div></td>
            <td>~€45–59/mese → <strong>~€540–700/anno</strong></td>
            <td>5 × ~€38/mese → ~€190/mese → <strong>~€2,300/anno</strong></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Implementation (one-time)</strong></td>
            <td>€0–2,000 — self-setup, no partner required</td>
            <td>€10,000–25,000 — partner-led project (IT localization, migration, training)</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Hosting</strong></td>
            <td>Included (TeamSystem cloud)</td>
            <td>Included in Custom SaaS; Odoo.sh +€25–115/mese if custom dev needed</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Total Year 1 (est.)</strong></td>
            <td class="price-good">~€540–2,700</td>
            <td class="price-high">~€12,300–27,500</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Total from Year 2+</strong></td>
            <td>~€540–700/anno</td>
            <td>~€2,300/anno (licenze sole, 5 utenti)</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>API access</strong></td>
            <td>Included in all plans (REST)</td>
            <td>Custom plan only — Standard plan excludes API</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Multi-company</strong></td>
            <td>Not available</td>
            <td>Included in Custom plan</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Multi-country</strong></td>
            <td>Not available (Italy only)</td>
            <td>100+ localizations included</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Future ERP expansion</strong><div class="aa-note">hypothetical — out of current scope</div></td>
            <td>Not possible — accounting ceiling</td>
            <td>Full ERP suite available (HR, CRM, Inventory, multi-company…) without platform change</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Free trial</strong></td>
            <td>14 giorni</td>
            <td>Free trial at odoo.com</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Setup complexity</strong></td>
            <td>Low — Italian product, guided onboarding</td>
            <td>Medium-High — requires Italian partner for initial configuration</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Regime 398/91</strong></td>
            <td>Config required — manual process</td>
            <td>Custom module required — partner build</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <div class="pricing-caveat">
      <strong>When Odoo's higher cost is justified:</strong> if TCA plans to manage additional club entities on the same platform, integrate with a parent group in multiple countries, or eventually expand beyond pure accounting — Odoo's Year 2+ cost (~€2,300/anno for 5 users) is competitive once the Year 1 implementation is amortized. If TCA remains a single accounting entity with no ERP ambitions, TeamSystem CiC is decisively more cost-effective at ~€540–700/anno.
    </div>

    <!-- ── NEXT STEPS ── -->
    <h2 class="aa-section-title">05 · Next <em>Steps</em></h2>
    <ol class="steps-list">
      <li><span><strong>Confirm TCA's legal form and regime</strong> with the accountant: ASD vs. SSD, and whether the club operates under regime 398/91 (commercial revenues vs. €400,000 threshold). This is the single most important filter before any software decision.</span></li>
      <li><span><strong>If ASD/SSD in regime 398/91:</strong> evaluate TeamSystem Sport (Sportivi in Cloud) as the primary candidate; assess whether its API integration is sufficient for Power BI / Looker Studio, or whether a two-layer architecture (TeamSystem Sport + TeamSystem CiC) is needed.</span></li>
      <li><span><strong>If SSD s.r.l. above threshold (full commercial accounting):</strong> proceed with the original finalist analysis — TeamSystem Contabilità in Cloud as first choice for its documented REST API; Odoo only if a full ERP is warranted and partner budget allows.</span></li>
      <li><span><strong>Two-week proof of concept</strong> on the chosen system: POST one real day of revenue (courts, bar, membership fees) with GL accounts and payment methods, then GET balances into a prototype dashboard.</span></li>
      <li><span><strong>Obtain TeamSystem's roadmap commitment</strong> for the chosen product before contract signature (December deadline).</span></li>
    </ol>

